direction: down
raw: "Raw accepted while idle / possible-idle\nretain next-evaluation debt"
coalesce: "Later raw replaces pending payload\ncarry coalesced debt coverage\nno old-message replay"
install: "Callback installs C / U\nidle event service is not consumption"
eval: "Actual next application evaluation\nqualified cancellation ERROR route"
notproof: "Empty / dummy / filtered-OK / unrelated ERROR\nno valid consumption witness"
returned: "Actual affected scopes return\nsource-neutral raw contributions\nno pending / claimed / re-marked installer"
blocked: "Debt / persistent U / unknown history\nrefuse clean reuse; preserve custody"
discharged: "RawHistoryDischargeReceipt\ncomplete terminal coverage\nnot an individual ERROR per request"
raw -> coalesce
coalesce -> install
install -> eval
install -> notproof
notproof -> blocked
eval -> returned: "selected path can meet premises"
eval -> blocked: "early ERROR can leave U"
returned -> discharged
